    <item>
      <title>Ph.D. Proposal Defense</title>
      <link>https://example.com/news/predefenseproposal/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 22 Aug 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://example.com/news/predefenseproposal/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I just passed my Ph.D. Proposal Defense today 🎉&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 5 p.m. to 7 p.m. Saudi Time, 22nd Aug, 2022, I presented my proposal&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exploiting Data Sparsity in Matrix Algorithms for Adaptive Optics and Seismic Redatuming&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I present &lt;a href=&#34;https://example.com/publication/slm/&#34;&gt;SLM algorithm&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://example.com/publication/tlrmvm/&#34;&gt;TLR-MVM algorithm&lt;/a&gt;
,
&lt;a href=&#34;https://example.com/publication/batchedtlrmvm/&#34;&gt;Batched TLR-MVM algorithm&lt;/a&gt; and
Mixed Precision TLR-MVM algorithm (submitted to ACM TOMS) during the presentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks my committees for helping me get through the Ph.D. proposal! I feel very lucky to have their support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I still have one year left for my Ph.D. life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below are two figures related.&lt;/p&gt;
















